	(text "V1.2 PARTIAL CORRECTIONS - NOT READY FOR POWER-UP OR WEARER USE\nF04: U4/C54 isolated from main rail. F05: R38 holds both LDOs OFF; operating power unqualified.\nF06/F18: restore U1 CLK_EN after RESET; allow U2 clock/POR; configure before shared START.\nF09: START/RESET/PWDN plus DIN/SCLK have pulldowns; CS/full sequencing unresolved.\nEnable/settle 2.4V reference; verify gain/rate; keep PACE/RLD/WCT and RLD rerouting off.\nF07/F08: protected body bias and wearer protection remain unimplemented." (at 266.7 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "36641f03-0935-496c-b896-3f1fdd73edb7"))

