(text "V1.2 F09: R36/R37 bias DIN and SCLK low; CS / full sequencing unresolved.\nF05: R38 = 0R FITTED: both LDOs held OFF. No functional enable source.\nKeep R38 fitted until functional EN, F13/F15/F16/F17 qualification is complete.\nUSB / external +3.3V can still backfeed the rail; OFF strap is not isolation." (at 171.45 330.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "04f61b6a-15e5-4d36-bc35-6d04d76031d4"))

(text "V1.2 F12/F14 - PROCUREMENT REQUIREMENTS (not qualified installed parts)\nR1-R32: 2k unchanged; 0.1%, >=0.1W, derating/pulse review required.\nAll 32 input 620pF caps: C0G/NP0, 1%; electrode impedance/CMRR still unverified.\nC25/C51 VCAP3: 1uF unchanged, >=10V; qualify capacitance at ~5.2V DC.\nC55 BP: 10nF unchanged; leakage <100nA at operating bias/temperature.\nNo MPN, footprint, physical performance or wearer-safety qualification is implied." (at 266.7 302.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "765b1a59-7d94-4d95-828b-f26584901a39"))

(text "F04: U4 output isolated with C54; no system load.\nBoth LDOs remain OFF. Qualify LP silicon/C54 before enable." (at 75 287.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bedf62a3-9c81-4c30-b485-0f034b55e6eb"))
